  "description": "Anna was dumped by his ex-boyfriend because he didn’t express his love well enough. On the night of the breakup, he gets drunk and satisfies his desires alone. Meanwhile, Kkikki, the monkey doll who had been guarding Anna’s bedroom, fulfills his wish to become human and try all sorts of naughty things, and turns into a human. Anna, who enjoyed his first encounter with Kkikki, pretends to give in and begins living with him. Kkikki seems to obey Anna at first, but soon begins demanding more extreme acts, as if to stimulate his hidden desires. \n\nMeanwhile, Kkikki must hear a “confession of true love” in order to live as a human forever. Unaware of this fact, Anna gradually begins to develop feelings for Kkikki as a lover— beyond just a sexual relationship…\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
